0" end="00:22.520"> veins</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.520" end="00:25.010"><span begin="00:22.520" end="00:22.520">날</span><span begin="00:22.590" end="00:22.670"> 구원해</span><span begin="00:22.710" end="00:22.780"> 주네,</span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:23.150"> now</span><span begin="00:24.610" end="00:25.110"> I'm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.010" end="00:27.060"><span begin="00:25.010" end="00:25.080">Dying</span><span begin="00:25.550" end="00:25.600"> in</span><span begin="00:25.790" end="00:25.860"> your</span><span begin="00:26.090" end="00:27.060"> arms</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.060" end="00:30.360"><span begin="00:27.060" end="00:27.160">Feeling</span><span begin="00:27.590" end="00:27.670"> like</span><span begin="00:27.950" end="00:27.990"> on</span><span begin="00:28.120" end="00:28.130"> a</span><span begin="00:28.170" end="00:29.670"> cloud</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.360" end="00:31.860"><span begin="00:30.360" end="00:30.370">혈관</span><span begin="00:30.390" end="00:30.390"> 속에</span><span begin="00:30.400" end="00:31.860"> 퍼져가는</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.450" end="00:33.210"><span begin="00:30.450" end="00:30.640">Taste</span><span begin="00:30.800" end="00:30.970"> of</span><span begin="00:32.630" end="00:33.210"> your</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.210" end="00:36.870"><span begin="00:33.210" end="00:34.310">Sweet-</span><span begin="00:34.310" end="00:34.490"> ee-</span><span begin="00:34.490" end="00:34.920"> eet</span><span begin="00:35.080" end="00:35.640"> venom-</span><span begin="00:35.640" end="00:35.890"> nom-</span><span begin="00:35.890" end="00:36.870"> nom</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.870" end="00:41.120"><span begin="00:36.870" end="00:37.050">Yeah,</span><span begin="00:37.110" end="00:37.160"> all</span><span begin="00:37.400" end="00:37.420"> I</span><span begin="00:37.580" end="00:38.580"> need-</span><span begin="00:38.580" end="00:38.680